# Plan-08 MC1.12.1 — keep the Docker build context lean.
# Anything not on this list ships into the daemon for the COPY commands.

# Build outputs
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/dist/
**/out/
**/wwwroot/
**/node_modules/

# IDE / editor
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# Local-only artefacts
.agenteval/
.git/
.github/
strategy/
docs/
benchmarks/
**/coverage*/
**/TestResults/

# Misc
*.md
!README.md
*.log
